-motors-and-other-stocks-likely-to-benefit-from-pm-ebus-sewa-scheme-to-deploy-10000-ev-buses/","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2026-03-24T13:00:00","source":"Trade Brains"},{"id":"537585","title":"Olectra Greentech shares surged 7.9% to Rs 1,104.45 as govt plans 10,000 AC e-buses by 2030.\nPM eBus Sewa to enhance mobility in 116 cities; Olectra set to benefit from rising e-bus demand.","summary":"Olectra Greentech shares surged 7.9% to Rs 1,104.45 as govt plans 10,000 AC e-buses by 2030.\nPM eBus Sewa to enhance mobility in 116 cities; Olectra set to benefit from rising e-bus demand.","url":"https://www.ndtvprofit.com/markets/olectra-greentech-share-price-surge-8-amid-govt-plan-to-deploy-10-000-ac-e-buses-by-2030-11257831#publisher=newsstand","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2026-03-24T10:31:20","source":"NDTV Profit"},{"id":"8904031094580729856","title":"HRTI Private Ltd sold 400,371 shares of Olectra Greentech at avg price of 1087.05.","summary":"HRTI Private Ltd sold 400,371 shares of Olectra Greentech at avg price of 1087.05.","url":"https://www.nseindia.com/report-detail/display-bulk-and-block-deals","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2026-03-20T21:00:45","source":"NSE Bulk Trades"},{"id":"530109","title":"Electric mobility stocks, led by JBM Auto, surged up to 14% on March 18, driven by strong volumes.\nJBM Auto, Olectra Greentech, Ather Energy, and Ola Electric saw notable gains, with JBM Auto reversing March losses.","summary":"Electric mobility stocks, led by JBM Auto, surged up to 14% on March 18, driven by strong volumes.\nJBM Auto, Olectra Greentech, Ather Energy, and Ola Electric saw notable gains, with JBM Auto reversing March losses.","url":"https://www.cnbctv18.com/market/electric-mobility-stocks-jbm-auto-olectra-ather-ola-share-price-surge-volumes-march-returns-smallcap-buzzers-19870542.htm","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2026-03-18T10:57:57","source":"CNBC TV 18"},{"id":"520021","title":"Olectra Greentech informed exchanges about an arbitration award disallowing Rs 10 Cr